{"id": "meda-tier3-financing", "title": "San Francisco approved $22.2 million in MEDA housing financing after a Tier 3 notice", "seconds": 129.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "0389cfea09d4a4f5", "words": 362, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[10]"], "text": "In the Mission District, a nonprofit called MEDA builds affordable housing.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.83, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Mission", "hoodLabel": "Mission District", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "kicker": "Mission Economic Development Agency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.26, 0.58, 1.49, 1.63, 2.31, 2.83, 3.38, 3.71, 4.17]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[10]"], "text": "Mission Local says it’s 53 years old, with more than 1,300 homes.", "t0": 4.95, "t1": 10.37, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Mission", "hoodLabel": "Mission District", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "kicker": "Mission Economic Development Agency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.73, 0.95, 1.13, 1.75, 2.02, 2.85, 3.11, 3.31, 3.5, 3.74, 4.2, 4.44, 4.73]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[9]", "story[0]"], "text": "It also gets City grants:", "t0": 10.49, "t1": 12.13, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City grants to MEDA", "sub": "fiscal year 2026", "chip": "$5,658,697.38"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.51, 0.74, 1.0]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[9]", "story[0]"], "text": "about 5.7 million dollars in the year that ended June 2026.", "t0": 12.13, "t1": 16.2, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City grants to MEDA", "sub": "fiscal year 2026", "chip": "$5,658,697.38"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.4, 0.72, 1.04, 1.34, 1.63, 1.96, 2.04, 2.13, 2.29, 2.46, 2.75, 3.04, 3.33]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "Mission Local reported that in October 2026, the City’s Controller put MEDA in Tier 3.", "t0": 16.32, "t1": 21.96, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Tier 3", "sub": "the City’s highest-risk category", "kicker": "as Mission Local reported"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.78, 1.22, 1.38, 1.49, 1.95, 2.21, 3.18, 3.36, 3.67, 4.25, 4.48, 4.83, 4.98, 5.27]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "Then how many days until the City moved to lend it more?", "t0": 22.08, "t1": 25.09, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Tier 3", "sub": "the City’s highest-risk category", "kicker": "as Mission Local reported"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.31, 0.52, 0.77, 1.0, 1.12, 1.4, 1.63, 1.75, 1.96, 2.1]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "9 days.", "t0": 25.09, "t1": 26.18, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "9 days", "label": "from highest-risk to a $22.2M loan vote"}, "emph": ["9"], "wt": [0.04, 0.38]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The first finding is the letter.", "t0": 26.8, "t1": 28.56, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-19", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "9", "fromLab": "Tier 3 letter", "toLab": "committee says yes", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.86, 1.09, 1.22]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "On October 19, Mission Local reported, the Controller listed 10 problems MEDA hadn’t fixed.", "t0": 28.68, "t1": 34.18, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-19", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "9", "fromLab": "Tier 3 letter, per Mission Local", "toLab": "committee says yes", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.62, 1.17, 1.49, 1.8, 2.66, 2.81, 3.3, 3.66, 3.96, 4.44, 4.68, 4.97]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[1]"], "text": "Tier 3 means City checkers couldn’t confirm what some of the City’s money paid for.", "t0": 34.3, "t1": 38.27, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "missing documentation for expenses billed to the City"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.58, 0.83, 1.11, 1.52, 1.86, 2.33, 2.49, 2.66, 2.74, 2.85, 3.18, 3.44, 3.7]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "The second finding is an insider.", "t0": 38.49, "t1": 40.48, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Unauthorized vendors", "sub": "set up by a former employee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Invoices", "sub": "for IT purchases"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Who approved them?", "sub": "duties not separated"}], "kicker": "The second finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.46, 0.86, 1.01, 1.13]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "Mission Local reported the audit found a former employee allegedly set up vendors without permission,", "t0": 40.6, "t1": 46.97, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "original2025", "kicker": "FY2025 signed audit", "text": "Finding 2025-001: vendor management, procurement and disbursements", "mark": "vendor management"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 1.45, 1.92, 2.05, 2.39, 2.69, 2.8, 3.12, 3.65, 4.2, 4.41, 4.56, 4.93, 5.25]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Controller’s letter, as quoted, called it self-dealing.", "t0": 46.97, "t1": 50.5, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Unauthorized vendors", "sub": "set up by a former employee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Invoices", "sub": "for IT purchases"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Who approved them?", "sub": "duties not separated"}], "kicker": "The second finding"}, "emph": ["self-dealing"], "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.75, 1.28, 1.5, 2.34, 2.63, 2.77]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[3]"], "text": "How could one person do that? The same person could create a vendor and help pay it.", "t0": 50.62, "t1": 54.79, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "segregation of duties was insufficient"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.35, 0.51, 0.87, 1.04, 1.87, 2.07, 2.34, 2.67, 2.85, 3.13, 3.21, 3.51, 3.62, 3.82, 4.07]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[4]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "How much money? Mission Local reported neither document gives an amount. Or when, or who.", "t0": 54.91, "t1": 61.02, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "original2025", "layout": "table", "heading": "Finding 2025-001", "context": "Signed audit", "rows": [{"label": "Amount", "value": "Undisclosed"}, {"label": "Forensic review", "value": "Initiated"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.42, 1.5, 1.89, 2.23, 2.72, 3.03, 3.48, 3.73, 3.82, 4.75, 4.98, 5.55, 5.77]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "The third finding is the loan.", "t0": 61.24, "t1": 62.72, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "2059-2065 Mission Street", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "an apartment building"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 0.81, 0.94, 1.07]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "At the same time, MEDA asked the City to finance an apartment building on Mission Street. How much?", "t0": 62.84, "t1": 68.93, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "2059-2065 Mission Street", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "an apartment building"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.28, 0.54, 1.29, 1.66, 1.95, 2.09, 2.4, 2.55, 2.98, 3.07, 3.49, 3.8, 3.89, 4.21, 5.03, 5.25]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "amount", "established[5]"], "text": "Up to 22.2 million dollars.", "t0": 68.93, "t1": 71.16, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$22.2 million", "label": "up to, in City financing", "sub": "$18,037,500 Small Sites + $4,120,000 seismic"}, "emph": ["Up"], "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.34, 0.91, 1.17, 1.39, 1.73]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "How would that work?", "t0": 71.68, "t1": 73.04, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Housing Accelerator Fund", "sub": "holds a $20.3 million loan"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "buys that loan"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "MEDA’s building", "sub": "the City becomes the lender"}], "kicker": "How the deal works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.32, 0.5]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The City would buy MEDA’s existing 20.3 million dollar loan from the Housing Accelerator Fund.", "t0": 73.04, "t1": 78.12, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Housing Accelerator Fund", "sub": "holds a $20.3 million loan"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "buys that loan"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "MEDA’s building", "sub": "the City becomes the lender"}], "kicker": "How the deal works"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.52, 0.69, 0.91, 1.27, 1.75, 2.12, 2.36, 2.59, 2.91, 3.19, 3.46, 3.63, 3.74, 4.11, 4.72]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "So the City becomes the lender.", "t0": 78.24, "t1": 79.77, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Housing Accelerator Fund", "sub": "holds a $20.3 million loan"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "buys that loan"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "MEDA’s building", "sub": "the City becomes the lender"}], "kicker": "How the deal works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.36, 0.63, 1.01, 1.14]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "On October 21, supervisors postponed the vote when the Controller’s concerns came out.", "t0": 79.89, "t1": 85.32, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-21", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "7", "fromLab": "vote postponed", "toLab": "committee recommends", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 1.65, 2.35, 2.86, 2.97, 3.39, 3.64, 3.74, 4.22, 4.67, 4.88]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "A week later, on October 28, the Budget and Finance Committee said yes.", "t0": 85.44, "t1": 89.86, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-10-21", "to": "2026-10-28", "days": "7", "fromLab": "vote postponed", "toLab": "committee recommends", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.36, 0.73, 0.89, 1.28, 2.31, 2.46, 2.85, 3.01, 3.41, 3.75, 3.96]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[6]", "notEstablished[3]", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "On November 3, the full Board adopted it.", "t0": 89.98, "t1": 92.41, "shot": "mayor", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "signed", "layout": "table", "heading": "Resolution 623-26", "context": "Signed City record", "rows": [{"label": "Mayor approved", "value": "November 13, 2026"}, {"label": "Loan term", "value": "At least 40 years"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.51, 1.11, 1.28, 1.54, 1.78, 2.23]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[6]", "timeline[11]"], "text": "Lurie signed.", "t0": 92.53, "t1": 93.4, "shot": "mayor", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "signed", "layout": "table", "heading": "Resolution 623-26", "context": "Signed City record", "rows": [{"label": "Mayor approved", "value": "November 13, 2026"}, {"label": "Loan term", "value": "At least 40 years"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[7]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Mission Local reported a housing official admitted supervisors weren’t always told about problems like this.", "t0": 93.52, "t1": 99.69, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "had not been consistent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.72, 1.15, 1.24, 1.61, 2.39, 2.99, 3.71, 4.03, 4.34, 4.62, 4.85, 5.34, 5.55]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[12]"], "text": "One more piece is a lead from news reports.", "t0": 99.91, "t1": 102.02, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Years of warnings", "kicker": "A lead, from news reports", "sub": "material weaknesses, per Mission Local"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.36, 0.65, 0.79, 0.87, 1.12, 1.31, 1.54]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[12]", "story[1]"], "text": "Mission Local reported MEDA’s auditors warned of", "t0": 102.14, "t1": 104.68, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "original2022", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2022 signed audit", "context": "Financial close", "rows": [{"label": "Financial statements", "value": "Material weakness"}, {"label": "Federal program controls", "value": "None reported"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.75, 1.23, 1.57, 2.05, 2.44]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[12]", "story[1]", "suspicious[3]", "established[13]"], "text": "serious accounting gaps every year from 2021 to 2024.", "t0": 104.68, "t1": 108.87, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "original2022", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2022 signed audit", "context": "Financial close", "rows": [{"label": "Financial statements", "value": "Material weakness"}, {"label": "Federal program controls", "value": "None reported"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.47, 0.91, 1.27, 1.56, 1.76, 1.97, 2.54, 3.15, 3.28, 3.56]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[12]"], "text": "Yet in 2025, the City approved a refinancing. How big?", "t0": 108.99, "t1": 113.3, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Years of warnings", "kicker": "A lead, from news reports", "sub": "material weaknesses, per Mission Local"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.28, 0.57, 1.2, 1.34, 1.59, 1.95, 2.05, 3.31, 3.58]}, {"scene": "lead", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[12]"], "text": "37.8 million dollars.", "t0": 113.3, "t1": 115.55, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$37.8 million", "label": "refinancing of 15 MEDA sites, 2025", "sub": "file 251009, October 2025"}, "emph": ["37.8"], "wt": [0.04, 0.71, 0.98, 1.2, 1.53]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "record", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "story[4]", "established[16]"], "text": "MEDA says an outside auditor found no unauthorized costs charged to grants,", "t0": 116.17, "t1": 120.47, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "hudreview", "layout": "table", "heading": "Separate HUD finding 2025-002", "context": "Report approvals", "rows": [{"label": "Tested report", "value": "Missing written approval"}, {"label": "Questioned costs", "value": "$0"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.66, 0.8, 1.25, 1.67, 1.9, 2.1, 2.74, 3.12, 3.45, 3.57]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "story[4]"], "text": "and that it has fixed the concerns.", "t0": 120.47, "t1": 122.21, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any City grant money was misused", "Whether the Mayor signed the financing resolution"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.38, 0.49, 0.68, 0.98, 1.08]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "No charge is on record. The amount involved is still unknown.", "t0": 122.33, "t1": 125.64, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.62, 0.76, 0.91, 1.6, 1.77, 2.07, 2.52, 2.62, 2.91]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 125.76, "t1": 128.13, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "find1": "Finding 1 · Tier 3", "find2": "Finding 2 · self-dealing", "find3": "Finding 3 · $22.2 million", "lead": "A lead · years of warnings", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "map", "hook": "contrast"}
